.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-taxes-patch - Partially update a tax


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 taxes patch  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates only the supplied fields of a non-deleted tax identified by its code.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and tax write permission on the API key.
Behaves the same as PUT. The tax wrapper must be nonempty, and omitted fields keep their current values.
The applied_to_organization parameter is ignored and existing assignments are not changed by this parameter.
Taxes have no supported expansions; a nonempty expands[] returns 400 before updating the tax.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--code\fP=""
	Unique code of the tax within the organization, including deleted taxes. It cannot be blank.

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	Internal description of the tax. Set to null to clear it.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for patch

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Name of the tax. It cannot be blank.

.PP
\fB--rate\fP=""
	Percentage rate of the tax. Accepts a number or a decimal string.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 taxes patch <code> --input @payload.json
  lago v2 taxes patch <code> --input @payload.json --output json  # full resource
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-v2-taxes(1)\fP
